    "intro_html":  "This is the stew that leans on beans to stretch the protein for very little. Ground turkey, cannellini beans, kale, olives, and tomatoes simmer into something thick and savory, then it goes over rice with fresh basil on top. Beans are the reason it works: they carry protein and fiber for pennies. Each bowl comes to \u003cstrong\u003e{{cal}} calories and {{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e for about \u003cstrong\u003e${{cost_ps}}\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost).",
